WEBVTT

00:00.168 --> 00:05.874
Yume toki ashita no koto wa

00:05.874 --> 00:11.005
Dareni mo mienu deshou

00:13.215 --> 00:18.676
Me o tojite kimi o omou

00:19.221 --> 00:24.853
Itsuka de au

00:25.560 --> 00:31.658
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

00:32.067 --> 00:38.336
Watashi no kono me ni haru o misete

00:38.673 --> 00:44.703
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

00:44.946 --> 00:50.976
Sayonara fuyu no machi

00:51.787 --> 00:57.851
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

00:58.260 --> 01:04.688
Watashi no kokoro ni haru o yonde

01:04.933 --> 01:10.997
Kaze no hana yo, Saa hiraku no yo

01:11.339 --> 01:17.278
Sayonara yukitachi yo

01:33.829 --> 01:37.866
In general, mages are assigned
to a variety of requests,

01:37.866 --> 01:40.266
depending on their
individual powers.

01:40.936 --> 01:45.202
A mage with a specific ability
is called a "Special Mage Agent."

01:49.077 --> 01:51.079
Mage Agents who work for
prefectures are the ones

01:51.079 --> 01:54.606
typically dispatched to use
their Powers for individual requests.

01:55.317 --> 01:58.153
Listen, mage! Don't pity me!
You got that?

01:58.153 --> 02:00.655
Those of you training to become
full-fledged mages will,

02:00.655 --> 02:04.648
under the strict guidance and
supervision of your instructors...

02:05.393 --> 02:09.386
Sunset and Steel Frames - Part 2

02:10.599 --> 02:15.070
After The Yokohama Treaty was passed in 1988,
"The Rights of People with Special Powers Act"

02:15.070 --> 02:19.207
and "The Mage Labor Law" were established,
and subsequently the current legislative system.

02:19.207 --> 02:22.110
and "The Mage Labor Law" were established,
and subsequently the current legislative system.
No, no. I must pay attention to the video.
The training. The training...

02:22.110 --> 02:23.407
The Bureau of Mage Labor is...
No, no. I must pay attention to the video.
The training. The training...

02:26.414 --> 02:30.373
Mage actions in the medical
field are strictly prohibited.

02:30.418 --> 02:35.991
Mage actions for medical treatment
require several steps of approval.

02:35.991 --> 02:39.628
I couldn't apologize to him properly.
I wonder if the way

02:39.628 --> 02:44.065
I used my Power was bad,
and that made him angry...

02:44.065 --> 02:46.268
Let's think about whether
Powers are good or bad...

02:46.268 --> 02:46.996
Let's think about whether
Powers are good or bad...
Huh!

02:49.571 --> 02:52.974
Powers alone might
generally be considered "good,"

02:52.974 --> 02:56.511
but if their effects on their
surroundings are ultimately negative,

02:56.511 --> 02:59.781
then they might be
considered "bad Powers."

02:59.781 --> 03:02.150
Forgery of money in circulation
or of stock certificates

03:02.150 --> 03:04.920
would greatly impact society and is,
therefore, strictly prohibited.

03:04.920 --> 03:06.788
would greatly impact society and is,
therefore, strictly prohibited.
Oh, no! I created
money with my power!

03:06.788 --> 03:07.889
Oh, no! I created
money with my power!

03:07.889 --> 03:10.926
Use of Power to interfere with life,
the organs and tissues that maintain life,

03:10.926 --> 03:13.929
or the structure of life is still
an active topic for discussion.

03:13.929 --> 03:17.332
This issue must be evaluated
in terms of the ethical, emotional,

03:17.332 --> 03:22.895
physical, and, of course,
spiritual impact upon society...
I might have actually used
Power that offended others...

03:25.407 --> 03:28.877
Mages are given authority to perform
their Power only after official requests

03:28.877 --> 03:31.212
are accepted at the public agencies.

03:31.212 --> 03:35.016
This is the fundamental principle
from which we operate.

03:35.016 --> 03:38.653
You are not permitted to perform
Power without an official request.

03:38.653 --> 03:39.312
You are not permitted to perform
Power without an official request.
What?

03:39.888 --> 03:42.924
With that in mind, follow your
teacher's instructions,

03:42.924 --> 03:46.621
and always behave
as a responsible mage.

03:47.862 --> 03:49.864
That concludes orientation.

03:49.864 --> 03:53.197
Everyone, do your best and
good luck with your training!

03:54.669 --> 03:56.364
Aspiring to Become a Mage
- Before Training Starts
- Educational Video for Mage Trainees #1

03:59.574 --> 04:03.510
Without a request,
I'm not supposed to use my Power.

04:10.251 --> 04:13.054
Oops, I've talked
way too much!

04:13.054 --> 04:16.217
Yume-chan of the Kikuchi Family!
How was the training video?

04:16.358 --> 04:18.223
It was very meaningful.

04:18.426 --> 04:21.596
You use your Power, and you're
always so sensitive to others.

04:21.596 --> 04:24.766
But if you're always tense,
you'll get exhausted.

04:24.766 --> 04:26.568
Relax and take it
easy now and then...

04:26.568 --> 04:29.469
Hey! Watch what you say
in front of an instructor!

04:29.971 --> 04:34.465
Sorry about that! I'm sorry!
I have to go now.

04:34.776 --> 04:38.735
Excuse me. I apologize in advance
for any trouble I may cause you.

04:39.481 --> 04:41.813
Oh, it'll be fine.
It'll be fine.

04:41.983 --> 04:44.850
Trainees often use Power
without permission.

04:45.053 --> 04:49.547
But I've hardly seen anyone
use Power of such magnitude.

04:56.698 --> 05:00.201
- I broke so many rules.

05:00.201 --> 05:01.099
- I broke so many rules.
- Oh?

05:01.436 --> 05:05.270
Without a request I used
my Power to produce money.

05:05.840 --> 05:08.172
I was only going
to make a little...

05:08.510 --> 05:11.079
Even if it's a little,
you can't produce money.

05:11.079 --> 05:13.809
Yes, that's right!
You're absolutely right.

05:14.015 --> 05:15.617
Do you think you'll ever
produce money again?

05:15.617 --> 05:18.450
No, no, I won't!
Oh, I'll never do that again!

05:19.087 --> 05:21.156
Rather than learning
by being scolded,

05:21.156 --> 05:23.224
if we regret our actions
through experience,

05:23.224 --> 05:24.626
we won't forget the lesson.

05:24.626 --> 05:26.321
Don't be afraid
to make mistakes.

05:27.762 --> 05:28.626
Yes!

05:28.963 --> 05:31.431
But still...
Try to avoid rash behavior.

05:32.000 --> 05:33.262
Yes.

05:35.537 --> 05:39.803
Ticket Number 10,
please come to Window 2.

05:51.519 --> 05:53.885
It's light. It feels like
I'm wearing nothing at all.

05:54.456 --> 05:59.723
This ring serves as an ID, and it displays
"power fragments" during a mage action.

06:00.662 --> 06:02.254
Fragment display?

06:03.665 --> 06:06.930
Oyamada-san's trainees are
all cute girls, aren't they?

06:07.268 --> 06:10.135
But I'd like to teach
cute boys, too.

06:11.706 --> 06:12.968
He's... y'know...

06:13.708 --> 06:17.439
Kikuchi-san, for your personal crest,
you want Kappa, the water imp, right?

06:17.645 --> 06:18.513
Huh?

06:18.513 --> 06:20.615
Well, that's what
it says right here.

06:20.615 --> 06:23.106
Ah! The crest... Kappa...

06:23.485 --> 06:27.155
My mother must have done
it without telling me...

06:27.155 --> 06:30.825
Well, I'm from Tono, Iwate Prefecture,
which is known for Kappa.

06:30.825 --> 06:32.486
So, that explains it...

06:32.894 --> 06:34.729
Excuse me, but could you
please wait a minute?

06:34.729 --> 06:37.061
I don't want Kappa!
Not that!

06:40.368 --> 06:42.996
Then what would you like to do?
Want to think it over for a bit?

06:43.404 --> 06:46.007
No. I just forgot to put
it on my application.

06:46.007 --> 06:48.109
I want a dolphin crest!

06:48.109 --> 06:52.205
Very well. Then please use your
Power and send it to this ring.

06:52.313 --> 06:53.644
Huh? Send what?

06:53.882 --> 06:58.148
The dolphin. You need to register
the image of the dolphin you created.

06:58.319 --> 06:59.616
Uh, of course...

07:14.402 --> 07:17.235
Kikuchi Yume-san,
your registration is now completed.

07:19.240 --> 07:20.764
Equipment Division

07:30.685 --> 07:32.448
How's the size?

07:32.687 --> 07:35.212
Yes, it fits perfectly,
like it was custom-made.

07:35.390 --> 07:39.156
Very well. With this uniform,
go do your best in your training.

07:39.861 --> 07:42.163
Good luck with
your mage training.

07:42.163 --> 07:44.199
Hey, there's no
need to thank me.

07:44.199 --> 07:45.427
Don't pity me!

07:48.636 --> 07:52.163
These bills...
didn't come from any bank vault.

07:52.874 --> 07:55.570
What do you mean?
Don't tell me...

07:55.944 --> 07:59.937
It means what I said.
These bills are created from nothing.

08:00.548 --> 08:03.142
That young girl used
that strong a Power?

08:06.921 --> 08:08.354
Pardon me.

08:08.523 --> 08:11.659
Yes. Please write up a report on that
case and submit it by the end of today.

08:11.659 --> 08:13.627
Oh! Councilor Furusaki
is on the phone.

08:15.296 --> 08:16.064
Huh?

08:16.064 --> 08:18.624
Ah, Angela.
How are you?

08:20.168 --> 08:25.504
Yume, she's a trainee, too.
This is Angela Brooks-san.

08:25.707 --> 08:28.676
Ah... Ah...
How- do- you- do?

08:28.776 --> 08:29.844
Hello.

08:29.844 --> 08:32.711
Uh! My- name- is- Yume- Kikuchi.

08:32.981 --> 08:34.448
Nice to meet you.

08:34.949 --> 08:36.109
Um... How- are- you?

08:36.217 --> 08:38.378
I'm speaking Japanese.

08:40.221 --> 08:45.523
I'm sorry. I've never spoken
to a foreigner before.

08:47.528 --> 08:50.361
Angela-san, are you in
the summer training, too?

08:51.232 --> 08:54.469
Angela's training
with the Master Chief.

08:54.469 --> 08:57.071
Impressive!
You must be really smart!

08:57.071 --> 08:58.538
She certainly is!

08:59.340 --> 09:03.071
She always uses outrageous powers!

09:04.946 --> 09:09.917
I brought a new trainee to see you,
Councilor Furusaki, as well as Chief Ginpun.

09:09.917 --> 09:11.885
The Chief is out
on a business trip.

09:12.287 --> 09:16.324
Is that so? Introduce yourself
to Councilor Furusaki.

09:16.324 --> 09:20.192
How do you do? I'm Kikuchi.
Thank you in advance for everything.

09:20.395 --> 09:22.664
So you're Kikuchi-san?

09:22.664 --> 09:25.724
I heard you used quite an
outrageous Power in the city.

09:26.034 --> 09:28.002
What?
How do you know that?

09:28.202 --> 09:32.639
All information regarding the
mages comes straight to me.

09:32.740 --> 09:35.402
He's not even a mage,
but he sure talks big.

09:35.576 --> 09:37.976
Angela-san,
what did you say?

09:38.179 --> 09:41.149
I didn't say anything.
May I leave now?

09:41.149 --> 09:43.777
I'm not quite finished,
so the answer is "No"!

09:44.185 --> 09:46.210
Angela, did you do
something again?

09:46.421 --> 09:47.820
It's no big deal.

09:47.889 --> 09:51.826
It IS a big deal! You gathered all
that jewelry without permission!

09:51.826 --> 09:53.589
You know that's
totally against the rules!

09:54.128 --> 09:57.665
I calculated the effects.
Everyone was happy.

09:57.665 --> 09:59.132
What's wrong with that?

10:00.068 --> 10:03.595
In my case, my Power did not
please the person affected.

10:05.840 --> 10:08.409
Um... Oyamada-sensei?

10:08.409 --> 10:09.569
Yes?

10:11.612 --> 10:16.606
Uh... I-I have somewhere
I'd like to go!

10:28.529 --> 10:30.264
I repeatedly warned the
Information Management Division

10:30.264 --> 10:33.324
to be aware of
Kikuchi Yume.

10:34.268 --> 10:35.636
Indeed!

10:35.636 --> 10:38.239
To produce
money from nothing!

10:38.239 --> 10:39.807
What a horrendous Power!

10:39.807 --> 10:42.310
Just the thought of the
abuse gives me chills!

10:42.310 --> 10:44.979
If she causes trouble,
how do you think it'll impact

10:44.979 --> 10:48.142
my position within the
Bureau of Mage Labor?

10:48.750 --> 10:52.186
Instructor Oyamada, please make
sure to keep an eye on her.

10:52.553 --> 10:56.224
Never let Kikuchi Yume use
her Power without permission!

10:56.224 --> 10:57.020
Yes...

10:57.692 --> 11:00.058
Shibuya Station

11:23.351 --> 11:25.386
Hey there, cutie.
Stop and talk for a minute?

11:25.386 --> 11:28.055
How about a part-time
job with great pay?

11:28.055 --> 11:29.386
Hey, wait!

11:30.191 --> 11:31.592
Can I stop you a second?

11:31.592 --> 11:32.193
- Would you answer our questionnaire?

11:32.193 --> 11:35.094
- Would you answer our questionnaire?
- I'm sorry. I'm sorry!

11:35.229 --> 11:36.992
Dogenzaka

11:37.298 --> 11:39.459
Oh, come on!
Give me a break!

11:49.977 --> 11:52.605
He simply might
not be in Shibuya.

11:59.020 --> 12:00.146
My Power...

12:00.521 --> 12:01.856
Oh, no, no.

12:01.856 --> 12:06.259
If he finds out that I used my Power
to find him, he may get mad again.

12:09.230 --> 12:10.925
Matsumoto Tsuyoshi Pharmacy

12:15.336 --> 12:16.860
That hurts!

12:26.414 --> 12:27.039
Huh?

12:30.751 --> 12:31.945
Uh! I'm sorry...

12:35.223 --> 12:36.290
There you are!

12:36.290 --> 12:37.458
You!

12:37.458 --> 12:39.227
Wow, I've been looking for you.

12:39.227 --> 12:43.264
Ah! Finally I found you!
I found you!

12:43.264 --> 12:44.595
What... What is it?

12:44.832 --> 12:47.668
I did not apologize
to you properly.

12:47.668 --> 12:50.404
So I wanted to
apologize to you.

12:50.404 --> 12:52.269
I am very sorry.

12:54.642 --> 12:59.547
Really. I'm sorry. My Power
was not welcome, right?

12:59.547 --> 13:02.016
I'm still a trainee.
So I'm not too good at it yet.

13:02.016 --> 13:06.053
Should I have used a different
Power to return your favor?

13:06.053 --> 13:06.951
Huh?

13:16.831 --> 13:19.766
Would you like a beef bowl?

13:20.601 --> 13:22.336
- Thank you. Come again.

13:22.336 --> 13:23.098
- Thank you. Come again.
- Order's up!

13:24.272 --> 13:25.296
Thank you for the food.

13:25.773 --> 13:28.674
When you're done eating that,
go home. I'm leaving now.

13:28.876 --> 13:31.640
Oh, wait!
How much is it?

13:32.046 --> 13:33.013
It's my treat.

13:34.115 --> 13:35.707
No! That's not acceptable!

13:36.517 --> 13:38.953
I'm a country girl, so I need
to ensure I behave properly so

13:38.953 --> 13:43.083
people don't say I'm pushy
or have no common sense.

13:43.958 --> 13:45.426
I need to make sure...

13:45.426 --> 13:48.963
That doesn't mean you have to
come all the way here to apologize.

13:48.963 --> 13:51.899
Uh...
But you were really mad...

13:51.899 --> 13:56.598
Of course. Because I wasn't nice
to you just to get something in return.

13:58.072 --> 14:00.942
You don't have to thank me.

14:00.942 --> 14:04.901
And the way you tried to repay
me sort of hurt my feelings...

14:07.248 --> 14:11.082
Don't... don't cry.
Please don't cry where I work!

14:21.729 --> 14:23.731
What's your name?

14:23.731 --> 14:26.097
Yume... I'm Kikuchi Yume.

14:26.334 --> 14:27.401
High school student?

14:27.401 --> 14:28.129
I'm a junior.

14:28.970 --> 14:30.071
Me, too.
I'm Zennosuke.

14:30.071 --> 14:32.273
Over here!
Hey, this way!
Me, too.
I'm Zennosuke.

14:32.273 --> 14:38.346
I just couldn't understand
why you got so mad at me.

14:38.346 --> 14:41.382
I came all the way to Tokyo
to be in mage training...

14:41.382 --> 14:44.476
And I made someone mad
right off the bat with my Power.

14:44.885 --> 14:46.580
Don't worry about it.

14:47.054 --> 14:50.217
I was insensitive, wasn't I?

14:50.758 --> 14:54.751
Without thinking about how you feel,
I used my Power carelessly.

14:56.731 --> 14:59.029
I went too far, too.
I'm sorry.

15:00.167 --> 15:03.137
And I cried because I was
so frustrated with myself

15:03.137 --> 15:05.605
for not noticing
that kind of thing.

15:14.415 --> 15:16.110
Thank you very much!

15:21.322 --> 15:23.758
Kikuchi-san, where are you from?

15:23.758 --> 15:26.556
From Tono,
in Iwate Prefecture.

15:26.727 --> 15:30.527
Now there's a
good soccer team!

15:31.098 --> 15:33.532
Is that so?
You know it well.

15:33.868 --> 15:36.203
I used to be on the
school soccer team.

15:36.203 --> 15:38.706
Used to? Did you quit?

15:38.706 --> 15:39.695
Yeah...

15:50.184 --> 15:53.017
When your training's over,
are you going to be a mage?

15:53.154 --> 15:55.389
Yes, that's my plan.

15:55.389 --> 16:00.918
Naturally I thought I'd
become a mage when I grew up.

16:01.062 --> 16:02.586
Naturally, huh?

16:03.264 --> 16:06.563
So you already have
a plan for your future.

16:06.734 --> 16:10.033
Zennosuke-san,
what do you want to be?

16:10.371 --> 16:13.074
I wanted to become a
professional soccer player.

16:13.074 --> 16:14.575
Wanted to?

16:14.575 --> 16:16.338
But I gave up.

16:17.278 --> 16:19.803
Did you come to dislike soccer?

16:30.424 --> 16:34.724
I asked for it. It was my
fault for driving a motorcycle.

16:35.763 --> 16:38.197
I was able to go back
to school after a year...

16:38.632 --> 16:40.964
But I couldn't rejoin
the soccer team.

16:41.535 --> 16:44.505
And I'm afraid of traffic
lights and crosswalks.

16:44.505 --> 16:48.242
I don't know what I'll do if traffic
starts before I cross the street...

16:48.242 --> 16:50.005
because I can't run.

16:50.211 --> 16:54.011
So when I saw you having
trouble at the crossing...

16:54.081 --> 16:56.914
I felt like it was
my concern, too.

16:58.519 --> 17:00.020
Pass. Pass!
This way!

17:00.020 --> 17:00.755
Pass. Pass!
This way!
I came to Tokyo and got lost.

17:00.755 --> 17:03.991
I came to Tokyo and got lost.

17:03.991 --> 17:08.195
Everyone was busy walking.
I asked for directions at kiosks,

17:08.195 --> 17:12.967
but I didn't understand very well.
I wanted to get to the station,

17:12.967 --> 17:15.469
but the traffic lights
were so complicated.

17:15.469 --> 17:18.097
That's when you talked to me.

17:18.305 --> 17:23.902
I was so happy.
I was really, really happy!

17:25.012 --> 17:26.001
I see.

17:26.147 --> 17:29.947
But still, I wasn't
thinking straight then.

17:30.317 --> 17:33.420
I used my Power thinking,
"Maybe this is good enough."

17:33.420 --> 17:34.785
I'm really sorry.

17:35.790 --> 17:37.348
Don't worry about it.

17:37.625 --> 17:40.150
But I'm a mage!

17:40.528 --> 17:44.430
I'd like to correct with my
Power what I did wrong.

17:44.598 --> 17:47.362
Please. Please let me return
your favor with my Power.

17:47.968 --> 17:49.570
I said not to worry about it!

17:49.570 --> 17:50.662
But...

17:51.906 --> 17:53.533
Well, make some
candy or something.

17:54.008 --> 17:56.909
A request? That's a request
for the use of Power, right?

18:03.017 --> 18:05.076
With all my precious
feelings in my heart...

18:39.353 --> 18:41.082
Uh! What's this?

18:51.799 --> 18:54.962
- You can do it!
- Give it your best shot!

18:55.469 --> 18:56.458
Zennosuke!

19:00.307 --> 19:01.433
Ugh! What?

19:02.142 --> 19:02.910
Shoot!

19:02.910 --> 19:04.104
Go! Go for it!

19:11.785 --> 19:12.774
Yahhh!

19:24.331 --> 19:25.199
- Whoa! Awesome.

19:25.199 --> 19:28.032
- Whoa! Awesome.
- Who are you? Wow! Cool!

19:28.235 --> 19:30.135
- Amazing!
- Awesome!

19:30.337 --> 19:32.673
- You're amazing.
- Who are you?

19:32.673 --> 19:33.741
I... just now... Um...

19:33.741 --> 19:36.076
- Where are you from?
- Hey, Mister, teach me!

19:36.076 --> 19:38.279
- That was such an awesome kick!
- What team do you belong to?

19:38.279 --> 19:40.114
- Unbelievable!
- Could you teach us how to do that?

19:40.114 --> 19:43.140
Ran... Dribbled...
And shot a goal...

19:44.518 --> 19:46.679
- We want you to teach us soccer!
- Teach us!

19:49.757 --> 19:55.696
- Let's play.
- Could you play and teach us?

19:57.631 --> 20:00.464
- You're so good!
- That was incredible!

20:00.834 --> 20:04.827
- Please teach us how to do that!
- Yes, please, please teach us!

20:15.883 --> 20:18.585
Again? Took action by
Grand Power without permission?

20:18.585 --> 20:20.849
That Kikuchi girl?

20:20.988 --> 20:23.980
I just warned her instructor,
Oyamada-kun, to keep an eye on her!

20:24.692 --> 20:26.785
What is he doing?

20:27.161 --> 20:29.830
He said it's fine. It's within
the acceptable range of training.

20:29.830 --> 20:35.496
I think the Bureau of Mage Labor
is a little too lenient.

20:36.904 --> 20:38.235
I'm home now.

20:38.572 --> 20:40.274
Welcome home...

20:40.274 --> 20:41.536
What happened, Yume?

20:42.109 --> 20:44.202
Were you off on some
exotic secret adventure?

20:46.547 --> 20:49.141
I thoroughly enjoyed
the town of Shibuya...

21:03.897 --> 21:08.527
The setting sun in this city
is huge and bright red.

21:09.036 --> 21:11.664
All the hardships and sorrow...

21:12.439 --> 21:19.242
The sun is gentle enough
to swallow them all.

21:20.347 --> 21:27.048
Furikaereba ima demo soko ni

21:29.790 --> 21:36.286
Oikaketeta mirai ga atta

21:38.065 --> 21:46.939
Boku no kokoro ni aru taisetsu na mono

21:47.441 --> 21:51.878
Mada mienai ao to

21:52.913 --> 21:59.842
Nagareru kumo ni negatta

22:02.589 --> 22:04.992
Under the Blue Sky

22:04.992 --> 22:11.864
Ano hi bokura ga egaita yume kara

22:12.132 --> 22:18.560
Samenai you ni tomaranai you ni

22:21.442 --> 22:23.610
Under the Blue Sky

22:23.610 --> 22:30.709
Kagayaki nagara aruiteikou yo

22:30.984 --> 22:36.422
Owaranai tabi wa tsuzuku

22:49.803 --> 22:51.566
PREVIEW

22:52.806 --> 22:55.036
I want to deliver
what's important.

22:55.542 --> 22:57.703
I want to deliver to
someone important.

22:57.878 --> 23:03.714
Far away, far away,
her wishes... my wishes...

23:04.485 --> 23:06.487
Because I can't use
words to convey...

23:06.487 --> 23:08.614
Because I want to
convey at all costs...

23:09.490 --> 23:10.824
important wishes,

23:10.824 --> 23:14.055
with all my precious
feelings in my heart...

23:14.261 --> 23:17.164
The Best News
Episode Three is
"The Best News."

23:17.164 --> 23:19.598
The Best News
I hope you look forward to it!
